Accept: application/json


### S-02 sortBy=createdAtUtc
### Очікуваний порядок:
### ...0004
### ...0005
### ...0003
### ...0002
### ...0001
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/search?q=&sortBy=createdAtUtc
Accept: application/json


### S-03 sortBy=severity
### Critical -> High -> Medium -> Low
### потім Id.
###
### У поточному seed:
### ...0002 High
### ...0001 Medium
### ...0003 Low
### ...0004 Low
### ...0005 Low
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/search?q=&sortBy=severity
Accept: application/json


### S-04 sortBy=status
### New -> Triaged -> InProgress -> Resolved -> Closed
### потім Id.
###
### У поточному seed:
### ...0003 New
### ...0004 New
### ...0005 New
### ...0001 Triaged
### ...0002 InProgress
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/search?q=&sortBy=status
Accept: application/json


